Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyPedestrianCrossing" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian in white athletic clothing" .
:actor2 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian in yellow athletic clothing" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrians crossing road in foggy conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Foggy weather conditions affecting visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Pedestrians crossing road in foggy conditions
Severity Score: 0.90

**Risk 2:**
